ue cuerpo a cuerpo con una antorcha encendida e impactas, causarás 1 de daño de fuego.\n\nDuración: Mientras se cumplen los requisitos..","showInActions":false}]$text_de7c9fd07470e6fa$::jsonb,true),'{rules,definition,description}',$text_5a4b49e76e85ed57$[{"id":"official-table","rows":[["Antorcha","1 pc","1 lb"]],"type":"table","columns":["Objeto","Precio base","Peso"],"section":"description","sourceIds":["srd-5.1-en-equipment"],"provenance":"reviewed-translation"},{"id":"official-rules-0","text":"Antorcha. Una antorcha arde durante 1 hora y emite luz brillante en un radio de 6 m y luz tenue otros 6 m más allá. Si realizas un ataque cuerpo a cuerpo con una antorcha encendida e impactas, causarás 1 de daño de fuego.","type":"paragraph","section":"rules","sourceIds":["srd-5.1-es-equipment"],"provenance":"official-spanish"}]$text_5a4b49e76e85ed57$::jsonb,true),'{catalog,revision}',$text_4e07408562bedb8b$3$text_4e07408562bedb8b$::jsonb,true),'{rules,definition,capabilities}',(select coalesce(jsonb_agg(cap||jsonb_build_object('textBlockIds',coalesce((select jsonb_agg(id) from jsonb_array_elements_text(cap->'textBlockIds')id where $text_bb21ed74d2f9e9dc$["official-table","official-rules-0"]$text_bb21ed74d2f9e9dc$::jsonb?id),jsonb_build_array('official-table')))),'[]'::jsonb) from jsonb_array_elements(payload#>'{rules,definition,capabilities}')cap),true),revision=revision+1,updated_at=statement_timestamp() where campaign_id='9e5f3b10-be82-456c-9e9a-c2ec4a6b97cd' and fragment_kind='character-inventory' and parent_id='chr_25160f73dc28f54f059e626dcb2ef288' and entity_id='inv_3bf0e8a833ce92332fac03a3e9f0cb18';
